{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Parkour on Anything</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Run along and up walls, swing on any bars or thin objects, slide, vault, get creative and break the game. Your speed and momentum translates to your moves - move and fall faster to climb and swing further.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No  perks to unlock, the only thing holding you back is creativity and skill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676250/extras/ItchInlineGif_CoolestMove.gif?t=1746129067\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Post-Apocalyptic Rome</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Humanity has moved on and left Earth to robots, factories and creatures. Unfrozen, it is now your turn to leave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Travel through the remnants of Rome and dystopian factories. Meet the creatures that have adapted to survive and find a way off planet.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Linear Levels, Open Approaches</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are always multiple approaches to any problem. Whether you're an explorative new player or a style-obsessed veteran, you'll find a path that works for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676250/extras/ItchInlineGif_SlideSwing.gif?t=1746129067\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Other Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Painterly art style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dynamic post-rock soundtrack that rewards you for being stylish.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In-game tutorial and videos to help familiarise yourself with the movement system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Designed for 1st-person and to be motion sick friendly.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3676250?t=1746129067","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3676250?t=1746129067","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676250/ffe6f0f7e26d849bf8f8bb621835dffdee6ef031/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746129067","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676250/ffe6f0f7e26d849bf8f8bb621835dffdee6ef031/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746129067","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Parkour on Anything</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Run along and up walls, swing on any bars or thin objects, slide, vault, get creative and break the game. Your speed and momentum translates to your moves - move and fall faster to climb and swing further.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No  perks to unlock, the only thing holding you back is creativity and skill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676250/extras/ItchInlineGif_CoolestMove.gif?t=1746129067\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Post-Apocalyptic Rome</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Humanity has moved on and left Earth to robots, factories and creatures. Unfrozen, it is now your turn to leave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Travel through the remnants of Rome and dystopian factories. Meet the creatures that have adapted to survive and find a way off planet.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Linear Levels, Open Approaches</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are always multiple approaches to any problem. Whether you're an explorative new player or a style-obsessed veteran, you'll find a path that works for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676250/extras/ItchInlineGif_SlideSwing.gif?t=1746129067\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Other Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Painterly art style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dynamic post-rock soundtrack that rewards you for being stylish.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In-game tutorial and videos to help familiarise yourself with the movement system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Designed for 1st-person and to be motion sick friendly.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Team Boars"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676250/0a15e14d15cd1b5122ffc04bde5d09eeed93255d/header.jpg?t=1746129067","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257126710,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257126710/movie480.mp4?t=1745614877","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257126710/movie_max.mp4?t=1745614877"},"name":"Movement Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257126710/c88ffed2d8c5397dcff5f8a9d4e8727f248156b1/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1745614877","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257126710/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1745614877","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257126710/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1745614877"}},{"highlight":true,"id":257126797,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257126797/movie480.mp4?t=1745614880","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257126797/movie_max.mp4?t=1745614880"},"name":"Stylish Gameplay Clips","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257126797/4b3d8d23f1e2cccdd52c3bb4365e49b6ca27296a/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1745614880","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257126797/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1745614880","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257126797/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1745614880"}}],"name":"Boars in Rome","package_groups